{
  "comment": "The filter lists Shields is built from (scripts/shields-pack.mjs, docs/shields.md). The lists marked ubol are uBlock Origin Lite's default rulesets: the pack builder reads uBO Lite's own catalogue (ubol.rulesets in the uBlock checkout) every time, adds a list its defaults gained and drops one they lost, so the default set follows theirs. The other lists are Niche's own choice on top (cookie notices, pop-ups, tracking codes in links). group: core lists are always used; the others belong to a switch in Settings ▸ Privacy; a regional list is used when one of its languages is among the Mac's. trusted lists may use the scriptlets that set cookies and storage (uBlock Origin's own lists only). extras are optional lists Niche offers beside uBO Lite's optional rulesets (Settings ▸ Privacy, More lists), each a pack of its own; details are the sentences Settings shows for optional lists, by id.",
